            <ArticleTitle>A double-blind single-dose evaluation of the relative analgesic efficacy and safety of carprofen in the treatment of postoperative pain after oral surgery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>273-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A clinical study to evaluate the analgesic efficacy of carprofen was conducted at the University of Colorado School of Dentistry. In a 6-month period, 248 patients underwent the surgical removal of wisdom teeth for analysis of postoperative pain relief.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
